/*
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Config file for defining DSL2 per module options and publishing paths
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    One file per module in conf/modules/<category>/<tool>.config, mirroring
    modules/nf-neuro. Each file holds the params specific to the module and its
    process options.

    This file is included before the profiles, so that profiles can override module
    params. Options depending on params must therefore be closures
    ( ext.foo = { params.foo } ), to be resolved once all params are set. Profiles
    must override process options with dotted assignments
    ( process.'withName:FOO'.cpus = 2 ): with the v1 config parser, a withName block
    in a profile replaces the module one instead of merging with it.

    Available keys to override module options:
        ext.args   = Additional arguments appended to command in module.
        ext.args2  = Second set of arguments appended to command in module (multi-tool modules).
        ext.args3  = Third set of arguments appended to command in module (multi-tool modules).
        ext.prefix = File name prefix for output files.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/

